From: "exe.dev user" <exedev@erbium-qemu.exe.xyz>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:13:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] sw-sysemu(erbium): erb_client.py test client and
 mailbox_worker firmware

tools/erb_client.py (python3, stdlib only) speaks protocol v1:
  erb_client.py SOCK ping | read ADDR LEN | write ADDR HEX | reset [KIND]
(commands can be chained with '--').

tests/erbium/host/mailbox_worker.c is a never-terminating minion firmware
that polls Mailbox0 for jobs (CRC32 / fill of 4 KiB in MRAM) and reports
in Mailbox1; used to smoke-test the host <-> erbium_emu <-> MRAM-file path.

Co-authored-by: Shelley <shelley@exe.dev>
